FIRST ORGANIZATIONAL RESOLUTION OF THE GENERAL PARTNER AND PARTNERS' CONSENT
RESOLVED, that the limited partnership is formed under articles 2236 et seq. of the Civil Code of Québec and the Act respecting the legal publicity of enterprises (RLRQ c. P-44.1);
RESOLVED, that the capital contributions, profit shares, and operating terms contained in the partnership agreement are approved;
RESOLVED, that the registered office is fixed at [address], Quebec, and the Registrar of Enterprises is instructed to record that domicile;
RESOLVED, that [Name] is appointed Managing General Partner and [Name] is appointed Manager, each authorized to open bank accounts and execute filings;
RESOLVED, that pre-registration expenses are ratified;
RESOLVED, that each officer may take all steps required to complete registration.
